# پلنتی — Project Rules

## Identity
- Persian RTL **grocery shop** (میوه‌های تازه تا در خانه), single vendor, not a marketplace
- Brand: **پلنتی** — fresh, calm, cream and deep leaf. Source: `src/config/brand.ts`
- Customer app only. Do not add admin or courier screens unless asked
- UI copy is **Persian (fa)**; `<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">`

## Access
- Login first. No guest shopping
- Public routes: `/welcome`, `/login`, `/register`, `/otp`
- Everything else requires a session. Gate lives in `src/proxy.ts`

## Shop rules
- Free shipping only when the cart total is **above** `FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD` (300,000 toman). At or below that, shipping label is «طبق قوانین»
- Cart, addresses, and orders persist in the browser (`plenty-shop`), not on a server
- Bottom nav is five tabs: خانه، دسته‌ها، سبد، سفارش‌ها، حساب (`src/components/layout/bottom-nav.tsx`)
- Screens sit in a phone frame, max width 430px

## Stack
- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, React Hook Form
- Run with **Bun** (`bun dev`, `bun install`)
- Do not add NextAuth, TanStack Query, shadcn, Sonner, or a Spring client unless asked

## Do not
- Port خانم‌خانوما (beauty marketplace, sellers) or other shop projects into this app
- Commit `.env` or create git commits unless the user asks
- Invent routes that are not under `src/app/`
